        "answer": {
          "short": "$14.2\\text{ s}$",
          "worked": "In ascending order, the times are $12.6,\\ 12.9,\\ 13.1,\\ 13.7,\\ 14.2,\\ 14.2,\\ 14.6,\\ 14.8,\\ 15.1$ seconds.\n\nThere are nine values, so the median is the fifth value: $14.2\\text{ s}$.",
